one Clarity request: 8 spans, 728 bytes each as the SDK writes them in JSON
(exporters usually send protobuf, which is smaller; the arithmetic is the same)

   requests a day  keep everything  tail-sampled   (stored for 30 days)
            1,000          0.17 GB       0.03 GB
           50,000          8.74 GB       1.27 GB
        1,000,000        174.72 GB      25.33 GB

The bill scales with spans per request as much as with traffic: an agent that takes
twice the steps writes twice the telemetry. A retention policy and a tail-sampling
rule are decided with this table in front of you, not after the first invoice.
